#: templates/admin/index.html:19
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "\n"
#| "        A HEA baseline is a data collection conducted for a country "
#| "during a specific reference year.\n"
#| "        A typical baseline includes data collected from representative "
#| "average households,\n"
#| "        serving as a representation of a wealth group within a community "
#| "in a given Livelihood zone.\n"
#| "\n"
#| "        The primary components of common baseline data include wealth "
#| "characteristics, asset profiles,\n"
#| "        household economy, and numerous other relevant metrics\n"
#| "    "
msgid ""
"\n"
"            A HEA baseline is a data collection conducted for a country "
"during a specific reference year.\n"
"            A typical baseline includes data collected from representative "
"average households,\n"
"            serving as a representation of a wealth group within a community "
"in a given Livelihood Zone.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Une ligne de base HEA (HEA baseline) est une exercise de collecte de données menée pour "
"un pays pour une année de référence spécifiée. Une ligne de base"
"comprend des données collectées auprès de ménages typiques, servant de représentation d'un groupe de richesse au sein d'une communauté" 
"dans une Zone de moyens d'existence donnée."
"\n"

